# The Merchant's Bidding (sandoria 69): Parvipon in Southern San d'Oria, no guard, no reward table. A trade while
# available (nothing), the offer 90 declined (option 0: nothing) and taken (option 1), the accepted 88, the wrong trades
# (a bone chip, two hides: nil), 89 for three Rabbit Hides (quest:complete: completed and fame +10; 120 gil; the hides
# taken), the completed 90 with option [7] = 1 (no finish handler), and the repeat 89 with four hides (quest:complete
# again: fame +10; 120 gil; three taken). Parvipon has no script; no other quest names him.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Parvipon/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Parvipon/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/90 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/89
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-170.1,-1,12.2
item RabbitHide x7
item BoneChip
login
trade Parvipon RabbitHide x3              # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Parvipon                          # available: 90
finish                                    # option 0: nothing
trigger Parvipon                          # 90
finish option=1                           # option 1: begun
trigger Parvipon                          # accepted: 88
finish
trade Parvipon BoneChip x1                # nil
trade Parvipon RabbitHide x2              # two: nil
trade Parvipon RabbitHide x3              # three: 89
finish                                    # completed, fame +10, 120 gil, the hides taken
trigger Parvipon                          # completed: 90 with option [7] = 1
finish                                    # no finish handler for 90 once completed: nothing
trade Parvipon RabbitHide x4              # completed: 89
finish                                    # quest:complete again (true): fame +10; 120 gil; three taken, one kept
